					"nextDialogs": [
						402201204
					],
					"speakerTitle": "明妮"
				},
				{
					"id": 402201204,
					"content": "虽然没能一起参加比赛，但至少还有这张合照。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402201205
					],
					"speakerTitle": "爱拉尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 402201205,
					"content": "觉得有遗憾的话，下届比赛再来吧，到时候拿个金牌回去。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402201206
					],
					"speakerTitle": "希诺宁"
				},
				{
					"id": 402201206,
					"content": "咳…下一次我一定要咳…来。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402201207
					],
					"speakerTitle": "汤义刚"
				},
				{
					"id": 402201207,
					"content": "你悠着点吧，下次可别感冒啦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402201208
					],
					"speakerTitle": "爱拉尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 402201208,
					"content": "队长，以防万一，下一次我也要跟着一起训练，至少还可以多一个替补队员。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402201209
					],
					"speakerTitle": "爱拉尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 402201209,
					"content": "那就约好了，下一次大家还要再聚！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402201210
					],
					"speakerTitle": "瓦雷莎"
				},
				{
